{
  "title": "Spondyloepiphyseal Dysplasia (SED)",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/pediatrics/4096/spondyloepiphyseal-dysplasia-sed",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Nov 15 2025",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Spondyloepiphyseal Dysplasia is a rare congenital disorder most commonly caused by a COL2A1 mutation leading to abnormal Type II collagen synthesis. Patients present with dwarfism, flattened faces, scoliosis, and in some cases gait instability as a result of cervical myelopathy.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made radiographically with presence of irregular ossification at multiple epiphyses, flattened vertebral bodies, and thoracic kyphoscoliosis. Flexion and extension radiographs of cervical spine should be performed to evaluate for atlantoaxial instability.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment involves a multidisciplinary approach to improve and maintain function. Spinal fusion is indicated in patients with atlantoaxial instability, cervical myelopathy, or progressive scoliosis.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "rare",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "caused by abnormal synthesis of **Type II collagen**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "primarily affects the vertebrae and epiphysis of bone",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genetics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "inheritance pattern",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "autosomal dominant (SED congenita)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "X linked recessive (SED tarda)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**random mutation (50% of cases)**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "mutations",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "COL2A1 on chromosome 12",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**atlantoaxial instability**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "frequent cause of myelopathy in spondyloepiphyseal dysplasia congenita",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "nephrotic syndrome (SED tarda)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Classification",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Two forms of SED exist",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**SED congenita**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "autosomal dominant",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "more severe than SED tarda",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**SED tarda**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "X-linked recessive",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "clinicallly less severe and does not have the lower extremity angular deformities that are present in the congenita form",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Symptoms",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**cervical myelopathy**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "due to atlantoaxial instability",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**respiratory difficulty**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "due to respiratory insufficiency secondary to thoracic dysplasia",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**problems with vision**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "due to myopia or retinal detachment",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**hip pain**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "due to coxa varus",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "**decreased walking distance**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "due to poor muscular endurance and skeletal deformities",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Physical exam",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "inspection",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**short stature**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**flatened facies**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "kyphoscoliosis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "lumbar lordosis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "coxa vara",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "genu valgum",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "motion",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "decreased ROM of hips",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "waddling gait",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Imaging",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
